OL,3,GNEWSA'I drank rainwater laced with
OL,4,Asticklebacks as a Fenland child'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA self-confessed "Fen Tiger" has
OL,7,Fdescribed how his 1930s Fenland
OL,8,Fchildhood involved collecting rainwater
OL,9,Fto drink and mostly living off the
OL,10,Fland.
OL,12,FDon Bradshaw, 96, grew up in a farming
OL,13,Ffamily and spent his formative years in
OL,14,Fthe village of Manea, Cambridgeshire,
OL,15,Fbefore later moving to nearby March.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
