OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1788674141
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I drank rainwater laced with
OL,4,Asticklebacks as a Fenland child'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he left school being unable to
OL,7,Fread and write as his father needed him
OL,8,Fto carry out chores on the farm, where
OL,9,Fhe recalled making homemade ketchup by
OL,10,Ftreading in a bath tub full of field
OL,11,Fmushrooms with bare feet to extract the
OL,12,Fjuice.
OL,14,F"We are a breed that is dying out,
OL,15,Fgrowing up in the fen," he said, adding
OL,16,Fit was "quite a tough life".
